  "content": "## World\n### Factory fire kills three, 36 missing — Confirmed\nRescuers found 15 survivors; firefighters were still tackling flames on Sunday. [a:00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000027] The cause is not yet known. [a:00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000028][a:00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000029]\nWhy it matters: it is the third deadly factory fire in Banten this year.\n### US and Iran open blockade exit talks — Confirmed\nTalks on ending the blockade opened in Oman. [a:00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001][a:00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004][a:00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005]\n",
